Meeting join links are now capability-bearing query-parameter URLs (`<base>/meeting-join/?key=<codeKey>&code=<codeValue>&domain=<domain>`), mirroring conversation join links. The join endpoints are `POST /meeting/{domain}/{key}/{code}/join?password=…` and the unauthenticated `GET /meeting/{domain}/{key}/{code}/code-check?password=…`: the stable `key` addresses the code row and the rotating `code` value is the capability, so refreshing a link invalidates every previously issued URL.
